      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003168",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "text": "STATE\nCada estado decide qué transiciones admite\n(publicar, pausar, reanudar, cerrar, cancelar).\nSin él: un switch por estado en cada método.",
       "left": 844,
       "top": 10751,
       "width": 286,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003169",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003092"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003168"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "987:10751;987:10643"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003170",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "text": "STATE\nCada estado decide qué acciones admite\n(aceptar, pagar, iniciar, completar, cancelar).\nSin él: ifs de estado repartidos en Contratacion.",
       "left": 10078,
       "top": 10639,
       "width": 298,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003171",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003054"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003170"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "10190:10639;10054:10498;10038:10489"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003172",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "text": "DECORATOR\nCada promoción envuelve al precio anterior;\nse acumulan en el orden en que se agregaron.\nSin él: un if por combinación de descuentos.",
       "left": 2358,
       "top": 10751,
       "width": 294,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003173",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003084"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003172"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "2506:10751;2509:10584;2508:10568"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003174",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "text": "STRATEGY\nReintegro 100/50/0 % según anticipación (48 h / 24 h),\no total si cancela el proveedor.\nOtra política es otra clase: Contratacion no cambia.",
       "left": 6560,
       "top": 10639,
       "width": 338,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003175",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003057"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003174"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "6721:10639;6682:10463"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003176",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "text": "SIMPLE FACTORY\nElige la política según quién cancela.\nQuien cancela no conoce las clases concretas.",
       "left": 6102,
       "top": 10395,
       "width": 295,
       "height": 61
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003177",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003058"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003176"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "6250:10395;6256:10109;6254:10093"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003178",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "text": "STRATEGY\nAfinidad por habilidades o popularidad reciente.\nCambiar el criterio no toca BusquedaService.",
       "left": 8308,
       "top": 7473,
       "width": 299,
       "height": 61
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003179",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS002955"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003178"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "8498:7473;8696:7322"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003180",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "text": "OBSERVER\nLos Services publican los eventos del dominio;\nlos suscriptores (NotificadorDeInteresados) reaccionan.\nSumar un suscriptor no cambia a quien publica.",
       "left": 8092,
       "top": 8974,
       "width": 344,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003181",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS002967"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003180"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "8264:8974;8264:8902"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003182",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "text": "SIMPLE FACTORY\nElige el EnvioNotificacion según el canal del perfil\n(interna, email o push).",
       "left": 14556,
       "top": 7247,
       "width": 310,
       "height": 61
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003183",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS002969"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003182"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "14674:7247;14535:7132;14538:7116"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003184",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "text": "ADAPTER\nAdapta el proveedor de email simulado a EnvioNotificacion\n(lo mismo PushAdapter y ServicioIdentidadSimulado).\nCambiar de proveedor no toca la aplicación.",
       "left": 16327,
       "top": 1191,
       "width": 364,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003185",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003121"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003184"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "16509:1191;16509:1113"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003186",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "text": "Contrato de la cátedra entre la UI y el backend:\nno se modifica. Lo que falta va en las\ninterfaces *Operaciones del equipo.",
       "left": 6646,
       "top": 3417,
       "width": 296,
       "height": 61
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003187",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002896"
       },
       "head": {
