      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS005417",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005339"
       },
       "text": "STRATEGY\nAfinidad por habilidades o popularidad reciente.\nCambiar el criterio no toca BusquedaService.",
       "left": 5195,
       "top": 766,
       "width": 299,
       "height": 61
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS005418",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005339"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS005367"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS005417"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "5398:766;5536:688;5798:615"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS005419",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005339"
       },
       "text": "OBSERVER\nLos Services publican los eventos del dominio;\nlos suscriptores (NotificadorDeInteresados) reaccionan.\nSumar un suscriptor no cambia a quien publica.",
       "left": 5385,
       "top": 2003,
       "width": 344,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS005420",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005339"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS005379"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS005419"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "5557:2003;5557:1931"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS005421",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005339"
       },
       "text": "SIMPLE FACTORY\nElige el EnvioNotificacion según el canal del perfil\n(interna, email o push).",
       "left": 4830,
       "top": 2128,
       "width": 310,
       "height": 61
      },
