       }
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS005975",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005877"
       },
       "text": "STATE\nCada estado decide qué transiciones admite\n(publicar, pausar, reanudar, cerrar, cancelar).\nSin él: un switch por estado en cada método.",
       "left": 280,
       "top": 1260,
       "width": 286,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS005976",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005877"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS005957"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS005975"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "467:1260;619:1127"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS005977",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005877"
       },
       "text": "STATE\nCada estado decide qué acciones admite\n(aceptar, pagar, iniciar, completar, cancelar).\nSin él: ifs de estado repartidos en Contratacion.",
       "left": 5135,
       "top": 1148,
       "width": 298,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS005978",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005877"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS005919"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS005977"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "5338:1148;5461:1061;5622:986"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS005979",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005877"
       },
       "text": "DECORATOR\nCada promoción envuelve al precio anterior;\nse acumulan en el orden en que se agregaron.\nSin él: un if por combinación de descuentos.",
       "left": 2108,
       "top": 1260,
       "width": 294,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS005980",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005877"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS005949"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS005979"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "2214:1260;2032:1093;2020:1077"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS005981",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005877"
       },
       "text": "STRATEGY\nReintegro 100/50/0 % según anticipación (48 h / 24 h),\no total si cancela el proveedor.\nOtra política es otra clase: Contratacion no cambia.",
       "left": 7709,
       "top": 1148,
       "width": 338,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS005982",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005877"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS005922"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS005981"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "7886:1148;7925:972"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS005983",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS005877"
       },
       "text": "SIMPLE FACTORY\nElige la política según quién cancela.\nQuien cancela no conoce las clases concretas.",
       "left": 8435,
       "top": 904,
       "width": 295,
       "height": 61
      },
